sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title ChalkTalk background job flow

    participant WebServer as Express web server
    participant Worker as Node.js worker process
    participant Database as PostgreSQL

    WebServer->>Database: Insert job with queued status
    Worker->>Database: Atomically claim job and load payload
    Worker->>Worker: Perform background work
    Worker->>Database: Store result and mark job succeeded
    Database-->>Worker: Record completion
